sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Researcher
    participant A as API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant V as Reviewer
    R->>A: Submit with current revision and rationale
    A->>D: Lock answer and append IN_REVIEW
    V->>A: Submit decision and expected revision
    A->>D: Lock answer and recheck role/revision
    alt Valid transition
      A->>D: Append decision and audit event
      A-->>V: New revision
    else Concurrent change
      A-->>V: 409 Refresh the answer
    end
